{% set title = 'Blue Marloc Tokens: Examples & Recipes' %}
<h2>{{ title }}</h2>

<h3>Show next month (YYYY-MM)</h3>
<pre><code>[bluemarloc:year-next-month]</code></pre>

<h3>Render a taxonomy term in a micro view mode</h3>
<p>
  Ensure a <em>taxonomy_term</em> view mode named <code>taxonomy_term_micro</code> exists and is configured.
</p>
<pre><code>[bluemarloc:term:261:taxonomy_term_micro]</code></pre>

<h3>Chain with core Node tokens</h3>
<p>
  Use the <code>basic-node</code> prefix to chain into Node tokens for Node ID 1.
</p>
<pre><code>[bluemarloc:basic-node:title]
[bluemarloc:basic-node:url]</code></pre>

<h3>Troubleshooting</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Confirm the Token module is enabled.</li>
  <li>Verify the term ID (<code>tid</code>) exists and is accessible.</li>
  <li>Check that the view mode for <em>taxonomy_term</em> is enabled and has a display configured.</li>
  <li>Clear caches after enabling or updating the module.</li>
</ul>
